  try{if(Array.isArray(PF320_PLAYER_LOG))PF320_PLAYER_LOG.unshift({version:PFV70,title:'Final Arena Polish',items:['The player always resolves first. Rival trash talk is larger, moved above the score and NEXT button, substantially meaner, and only appears occasionally.','Fire beats Nature, Water beats Fire, and Nature beats Water everywhere in previews, real damage and AI evaluation. Fire has a clearer flame mark.','Battle cards keep the old plain-text Health treatment with Attack directly beneath it—no stat boxes—across desktop, Chromebook and mobile.','Skill moves were strengthened and speed-only Skill value was converted into useful combat effects.','High-rank rivals make smarter move choices and Master/Apex card pools are modestly stronger while rival swapping is even rarer.','Colin Barnes is intentionally plain brown with normal Inspect/Sell controls. Decorative card tags were removed while Serialized numbering stays visible; Wyatt Evans and Jet Lumagui are 6 HP / 0 ATK Arena jokes.','HP animation DOM work and transient element effects were capped/reduced for lower-end hardware; the standalone remains local-only with no new network calls.']})}catch(e){}
  /* ==================== PackForge v3.72 — Ranked Refresh Penalty + Deck Sort Cleanup ==================== */
